  <metadata>
    <name>Jim Beam: Clermont, Salt River salt and Civil War forts · Loop 1: Salt River and Fort Duffield</name>
    <desc>Starting at Jim Beam in Clermont: the Bullitt&apos;s Lick salt works, the Salt River falls at Shepherdsville, and a Union fort above West Point. Public, exact waypoints only. Private land and approximate stops are omitted. https://kyhistorydrive.com/drives/jim-beam/</desc>
    <link href="https://kyhistorydrive.com/drives/jim-beam/"><text>Jim Beam: Clermont, Salt River salt and Civil War forts · Loop 1: Salt River and Fort Duffield</text></link>
  </metadata>
  <wpt lat="37.9298" lon="-85.6527">
